meta {
  name: Delete Product
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/products/{{productId}}
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Delete Product

  Soft-deletes a product (sets IsActive = false).

  ## Path Parameters

  | Parameter | Type | Description |
  |-----------|------|-------------|
  | productId | GUID | The product ID |

  ## Response

  Returns `204 No Content` on success.

  ## Notes

  - This is a soft delete - the product is deactivated, not removed
  - Deactivated products won't appear in product listings
  - Historical sales data referencing this product is preserved

  ## Authorization

  Requires `products.manage` capability (Manager, Admin).
}
